12. To establish a claim for malicious prosecution, the plaintiff must prove the following essentials :-
(i) Prosecution by the defendant. ;
 (ii) Absence of reasonable and probable cause. ;
 (iii) Malice ;
 (iv) Termination of proceedings in favour of  the plaintiff.
